# UI + RAF

- RAF in `useEffect` on DisplayStage / `useEngineLoop`. **No `setState` inside the frame tick.**
- Read config via `configRef.current` each frame.
- Cleanup: `cancelAnimationFrame` + `effect.dispose?()`; Strict Mode safe (idempotent).
- Reinit effects in a separate effect when text/effectId/size/direction change — not inside `tick`.
- Prefer `data-testid` from `14` §7: `display-stage`, `text-input`, `effect-select`, `play-pause`, `fullscreen-btn`, `speed-slider`.
- Labels Vietnamese; touch targets ≥ 44px.
- Fullscreen target = DisplayStage; always implement pseudo-fullscreen fallback.
